# Project settings for the GitHub workflows (which are copied verbatim, not
# rendered). Read as data, never sourced by a shell: one NAME=VALUE per line,
# no quoting needed even when a value contains spaces; lines starting with #
# are comments. Only known settings are accepted (the workflows refuse any
# other name, so this file cannot change how their steps run).
# Where the workflows install graph-agents-cli from (uvx --from "$GRAPH_AGENTS_CLI_SPEC").
GRAPH_AGENTS_CLI_SPEC={{cookiecutter.cli_install_spec}}
